{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/40da926ef543c6e73e5608178e203c60.poster.avif?t=1770584635\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/40da926ef543c6e73e5608178e203c60.webm?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/40da926ef543c6e73e5608178e203c60.mp4?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unreal Zombies is single player First Person Shooter Horror game with an emphasis on strategy and survival. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Stand at the worlds edge and watch it all burn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world that was once your home; You\u2019ve been sent to mysterious ruins by a failed science test, one that started the research to make immortality possible, and your only goal is to find your way out. You play as Rust. A nobody who welds together his own weapons to fight the never ending horde. With his skills alone, he must make new weapons, fight ever stronger monsters, try to find clues as to who destroyed his home, and possibly save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/8bd3aac975d4db54127e594f43a0042b.poster.avif?t=1770584635\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/8bd3aac975d4db54127e594f43a0042b.webm?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/8bd3aac975d4db54127e594f43a0042b.mp4?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAMPAIGN:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Speed won't hold you back, but the enemies sure can. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through brutally difficult levels and beat the odds in the campaign! Kill zombies and find power-ups to enhance your style! Maybe even test your skill in the <strong>Unreal</strong> difficulty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/6f6018f1c946b4fba37eb19452900baf.poster.avif?t=1770584635\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/6f6018f1c946b4fba37eb19452900baf.webm?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/6f6018f1c946b4fba37eb19452900baf.mp4?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Push yourself to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want something a little faster? Something to get your heart pumping? Survival mode might be for you! A game-mode designed specifically to harness the speed of the player control and make every run as blood curdling as possible. Go through an ever changing labyrinth picking up 1 of 4 randomly generated power-ups! Faster, Crazier, Deadlier. Are you up to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/e9668a629b7335aaead883170ffc1875.poster.avif?t=1770584635\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/e9668a629b7335aaead883170ffc1875.webm?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/e9668a629b7335aaead883170ffc1875.mp4?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A New Beginning!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/316c3c066485550eb01c54a597831796222ad0cb.jpg"},{"name":"Zombies in the Forest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/631a3590f56e3f1ad862289d2b09265f83cf8bc0.jpg"},{"name":"We're meeting G over there","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/4d5abcc6976e289c56d3d3657067813a23f1f3ee.jpg"},{"name":"Frostbite and an Engine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/0db992cd967d61ec60857ad938afa1cbe2cef54b.jpg"},{"name":"HeadTwister!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/4c7847474eac156bc477d16dcb01451b9ed74bcb.jpg"},{"name":"Did you bring a light?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/22d4d950a229e276f868e67a8c4975d4592272b3.jpg"},{"name":"We all live in a yellow submarine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/62a74abba3caaef866112cd2bd80083b26b90d0a.jpg"},{"name":"Kick the Baby!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/ac193e2ce28a01bae617248200a58372faffd19f.jpg"},{"name":"\"...Until it is done\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3563810/a8dd36f42c0a192cebb654b7c77e3851d007612b.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563810?t=1770584635","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/2908ab3459f95edbf303eff1ee54d77f439fc607/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770584635","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/a1c93673c7007370aade5217774cd85aff7eee37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770584635","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/a1c93673c7007370aade5217774cd85aff7eee37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770584635","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Unreal Zombies contains violence, blood and gore, flashing lights, loud noises, and some strong language which may be unsuitable for some users."},"demos":[{"appid":3715560,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/40da926ef543c6e73e5608178e203c60.poster.avif?t=1770584635\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/40da926ef543c6e73e5608178e203c60.webm?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/40da926ef543c6e73e5608178e203c60.mp4?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unreal Zombies is single player First Person Shooter Horror game with an emphasis on strategy and survival. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Stand at the worlds edge and watch it all burn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world that was once your home; You\u2019ve been sent to mysterious ruins by a failed science test, one that started the research to make immortality possible, and your only goal is to find your way out. You play as Rust. A nobody who welds together his own weapons to fight the never ending horde. With his skills alone, he must make new weapons, fight ever stronger monsters, try to find clues as to who destroyed his home, and possibly save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/8bd3aac975d4db54127e594f43a0042b.poster.avif?t=1770584635\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/8bd3aac975d4db54127e594f43a0042b.webm?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/8bd3aac975d4db54127e594f43a0042b.mp4?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAMPAIGN:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Speed won't hold you back, but the enemies sure can. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through brutally difficult levels and beat the odds in the campaign! Kill zombies and find power-ups to enhance your style! Maybe even test your skill in the <strong>Unreal</strong> difficulty!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/6f6018f1c946b4fba37eb19452900baf.poster.avif?t=1770584635\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/6f6018f1c946b4fba37eb19452900baf.webm?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/6f6018f1c946b4fba37eb19452900baf.mp4?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVAL:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Push yourself to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want something a little faster? Something to get your heart pumping? Survival mode might be for you! A game-mode designed specifically to harness the speed of the player control and make every run as blood curdling as possible. Go through an ever changing labyrinth picking up 1 of 4 randomly generated power-ups! Faster, Crazier, Deadlier. Are you up to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/e9668a629b7335aaead883170ffc1875.poster.avif?t=1770584635\" width=600 height=172 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/e9668a629b7335aaead883170ffc1875.webm?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563810/extras/e9668a629b7335aaead883170ffc1875.mp4?t=1770584635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-ali